  "Personally steal Diamond Phoenix and Platinum Crown from The Sovereign Collection, then certify both as originals. Auction purchases do not qualify. Confirmed progress: ": "Roba personalmente Diamond Phoenix y Platinum Crown de The Sovereign Collection y luego certifica ambas como originales. Las compras en subasta no califican. Progreso confirmado: ",
